但直觉告诉我他就是圣诞老人 妈妈
But I've got a feeling he is Santa Claus, Mother.

44
00:01:47,190 --> 00:01:49,660
有人不相信圣诞老人真的存在 所以...
Some people don't believe that. That's why-

45
