我们看的是《萨拉萨尔和大熊拯救圣诞》
And all we see there is Salazar and El Oso Save Christmas.

53
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:08,940
-听上去很经典啊 -确实
- Sounds like a classic. - It is.

54
00:02:09,020 --> 00:02:10,680
