64
00:02:29,524 --> 00:02:31,492
你就是傻冒
You are the inocente!

65
00:02:31,540 --> 00:02:33,475
我好像有点弄不明白状况了
Well, maybe I'm a little confused right now.

66
00:02:33,475 --> 00:02:35,260
什么是傻冒
What is this "Inocente" Stuff?

67
00:02:35,260 --> 00:02:37,820
在哥伦比亚 恶作剧是圣诞传统
In Colombia, practical jokes are a Christmas tradition.

68
00:02:37,913 --> 00:02:40,972
被愚弄的人就是傻冒
The one that is fooled is the inocente!

69
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:43,320
我们在愚人节时才会恶作剧
We tell practical jokes on April Fool's Day,

70
00:02:43,420 --> 00:02:45,249
千万别再搞这一套了
So do not do that again.

71
00:02:46,477 --> 00:02:47,788
傻冒
"Inocente."

72
