知道吗 某人需要融入这个节日 妈的
You know what? Somebody needs to get in the holiday- son of a bitch.

79
00:03:09,380 --> 00:03:10,880
也许不是他们呢
Maybe it's not them.

80
00:03:11,300 --> 00:03:12,540
就是他们
Oh, it's them.

81
00:03:13,940 --> 00:03:14,780
就是他们
It's them.

82
00:03:15,580 --> 00:03:18,160
3年前 我组织了一个唱诗班
Three years ago, I formed a caroling group.

83
00:03:18,580 --> 00:03:20,020
名字是"绿袖子颂歌班"
We were known as The Greensleevers.

84
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:22,140
我们会在慈善活动现场和医院演奏
We would perform at charity events, hospitals-

85
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:23,840
当时可是红遍大江南北
They were very, very popular.

86
00:03:23,912 --> 00:03:28,457
去年 我的一名成员
Uh, last year, one of my carolers-

87
