谢谢
Thank you.

91
00:03:58,820 --> 00:04:01,140
我们是"新"绿袖子颂歌班
We're the New Greensleevers.

92
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:05,500
新绿袖子
The New Greensleevers?

93
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:07,280
简直是狠狠抽了我一巴掌嘛
Is there a slap mark on my face?

94
00:04:07,340 --> 00:04:09,240
为什么让埃德娜唱低声部的合音
I mean, why is Edna singing the low harmony?

95
00:04:09,780 --> 00:04:11,597
观众像是因为震惊才鼓掌一样
It's like people are applauding out of shock.

96
00:04:11,597 --> 00:04:12,426
-随他们去吧 -为什么
- Let it go. - Why would-

97
00:04:12,426 --> 00:04:14,971
-好的 下一个 -终于啊
- Okay, next. - Ah, finally.

98
00:04:16,709 --> 00:04:20,320
抱歉 我能 你能
Whoa! I'm- I'm sorry. Can I- Could you-

99
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:21,480
另一个圣诞老人怎么了
What happened to the other Santa?

100
00:04:21,780 --> 00:04:23,840
听着 我们排队真的排了很久
Listen, we've been waiting in this line for a really long time,

101
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:26,360
我们只想要一个有圣诞老人样子的圣诞老人
and we just want a Santa that actually looks like Santa.

102
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,540
米奇尔 没事的
Mitchell, it's okay.

103
00:04:27,540 --> 00:04:29,020
不不 小卡 不行
No, no, no. Cam, it's not okay.

104
00:04:29,020 --> 00:04:30,280
这是莉莉过的第一个圣诞节
This is Lily's first Christmas.

105
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:31,780
我想确保一切都很完美
I want to make sure everything is perfect.

106
00:04:32,256 --> 00:04:34,998
我们要等那个胖圣诞老人 明白吗
We're gonna wait for the fat Santa. All right?

107
00:04:35,160 --> 00:04:36,120
我就知道会这样
I knew this would happen.

108
00:04:36,688 --> 00:04:38,419
我 我真不知道我们为什么雇佣这家伙
I-I don't even know why we hired this guy.

109
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:40,940
瞧 连他的精灵都同意我的话 谢谢
See? Even his elves agree with me. Thank you.

110
00:04:41,140 --> 00:04:43,240
没想到圣诞让你变得如此龟毛
I didn't know Christmas made you so petty.

111
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:47,000
逊毙了
Lackluster!

112
00:04:50,940 --> 00:04:52,120
我恨你们
I hate you!

113
00:04:52,260 --> 00:04:54,380
我绝对不能接受你们吸烟 到底是谁
This is unacceptable, and I want to know who did this.

114
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:57,240
没人吗
Nobody, huh?

115
00:04:58,440 --> 00:04:59,960
我猜是沙发自己把自己烫了个小洞
I guess the couch did it to itself.

116
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,720
辛苦的一天后回到家
Guess it came home after a tough day,

117
