点了支烟 烧到了它自己
lit up a cigarette and then it burned itself.

118
00:05:03,780 --> 00:05:06,060
是这样吗 可真是荒谬
Is that what happened? Because that makes no sense.

119
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:08,420
真正的烟民如果不站出来
If whoever is responsible doesn't come forward,

120
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:10,560
我们会将你们三个统统作为惩罚对象
your father and I are just gonna have to punish all three of you.

121
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:11,160
什么
What?

122
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:13,700
-这不公平 -我能原谅你们抽烟
- That's not fair! - I can forgive the smoking,

123
00:05:13,780 --> 00:05:15,240
-但是不能原谅撒谎 -不对
- but I can't forgive the lie. - No.

124
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:16,080
抽烟也不能原谅
Or the smoking.

125
00:05:18,580 --> 00:05:20,798
没人主动承认 真没有吗
No one wants to confess, huh? No?

126
00:05:20,798 --> 00:05:23,983
没关系 知道接下来会怎样吗
That's fine, 'cause you know what happens next?

127
00:05:24,060 --> 00:05:25,580
我们取消圣诞节
We cancel Christmas!

128
00:05:27,700 --> 00:05:28,720
这不公平
That's not fair.

129
00:05:28,900 --> 00:05:30,080
好吧 老爸
Okay, Dad, sure.

130
00:05:30,340 --> 00:05:33,360
菲尔喜欢在孩子面前夸海口
Phil has a habit of making big pronouncements to the kids.

131
00:05:34,780 --> 00:05:36,120
有一次我告诉卢克
One time I told Luke...

132
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:38,580
如果他不把他的脏碗放进洗碗机
that if he didn't put his dirty dishes in the dishwasher,

133
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:40,400
我们就把脏碗放他床上
we would put them in his bed.

134
00:05:40,744 --> 00:05:43,851
菲尔的问题就是 坚持到底
Phil's problem is follow-through.

135
00:05:46,520 --> 00:05:47,638
然后我们就没有碟子了
We had no more dishes,

136
00:05:47,638 --> 00:05:50,906
所以最后只能用金鱼缸吃麦片
so we were eating cereal out of the goldfish bowl.

137
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,180
好吧 猜猜我现在要去干什么
Okay. Guess where I'm headed?

138
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:55,900
把圣诞树砍了 就是这样
To take down the tree. That's right.

139
00:05:55,940 --> 00:05:57,260
-快坦白吧 -这是你们最后的机会了
- Come on, guys. - This is your last chance.

140
00:05:57,460 --> 00:05:59,680
不管是谁做的 要勇于承担责任
Whoever did this, just take responsibility.

141
00:05:59,740 --> 00:06:03,100
不要连累其他人 卢克 不是吗
Don't put the rest of us through this. Luke? No?

142
00:06:03,100 --> 00:06:05,960
那就这样吧 好吧 真砍了哦
This is really it. Okay? Here we go.

143
00:06:09,140 --> 00:06:11,200
三 二 一
Three, two, one.

144
00:06:12,347 --> 00:06:14,940
好吧 再见 邓菲家的圣诞节
Okay. Good-bye, Dunphy Christmas.

145
00:06:14,940 --> 00:06:16,400
海莉 我估计你拿不到新车做礼物了
Haley, I guess you're not getting that car.

146
00:06:16,464 --> 00:06:18,180
-我能得到新车作为礼物吗 -不会了
- I was getting a car? - Nope.

147
00:06:18,180 --> 00:06:19,880
我撒谎的 因为现在就流行撒谎
I was lying, because that's what we do now.

148
00:06:19,980 --> 00:06:20,820
邓菲一家人都是撒谎精
Dunphys are liars.

149
00:06:29,460 --> 00:06:32,220
我当老大的时候 一切都以音乐为中心
When I was in charge, it was all about the music.

150
00:06:32,580 --> 00:06:35,480
为什么他们要在唱完歌后 把拐杖糖扔给观众
I mean, what's with them tossing out candy canes after every carol?

151
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:37,120
-就是为了迎合 -我认为你
- It's pandering. - I think you

152
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,580
把糖又扔回去 已经表明了你的反感
made that clear when you tossed them back.

153
00:06:38,620 --> 00:06:40,460
我怎样才能把这些东西都放进车里啊
How am I supposed to get all this in the car?

154
00:06:40,580 --> 00:06:42,200
-我来帮帮你们吧 -谢谢
- Let me give you a hand with that. - Uh, thanks.

155
00:06:42,620 --> 00:06:44,780
-谢谢 圣诞老人 -别再那么叫了
- Thanks. Thanks, Santa. - Can't call me that anymore.

156
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:46,380
我刚被炒鱿鱼了
Just got canned.

157
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:48,680
真的吗
Oh- really?

158
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,980
估计是有一些人投诉 说我不够胖
Guess a couple people complained I wasn't fat enough.

159
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,200
那可真糟糕
Well, that's terrible.

160
00:06:52,660 --> 00:06:54,880
我不想过胖又引发心脏病 现在就这下场
That's what I get for trying not to have a second heart attack.

161
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:57,700
行了 空间总是能腾出来的
There you go. Always a way to make room.

162
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,600
我作为住在车里的人 给你们的箴言
Take it from someone who lives in his car.

163
00:06:59,702 --> 00:07:02,458
那个 非常感谢你
Oh, well, thank you so much.

164
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:04,520
没事儿 圣诞快乐
No problem. Merry Christmas.

165
00:07:04,581 --> 00:07:05,856
等等 麻烦您
Um, wait, wait. Um, please,

166
00:07:05,856 --> 00:07:07,809
让我给你些小费...
uh, let me give you a little something...

167
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:09,347
-感谢你过来帮忙 -不 没关系的
- for your troubles. - No, that's okay.

168
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:11,540
-天啊 真的吗 -你真住在车里吗
- Gosh. Really? Okay. -Do you really live in your car?

169
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,780
是啊 不过也没那么糟糕
Yeah. It's not so bad.

170
00:07:13,900 --> 00:07:16,540
我妻子搬出去后 就宽敞多了
It's pretty roomy since the wife moved out.

171
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:19,140
不如你今晚到我们家来共进晚餐吧
Why don't you come over to our place for dinner tonight?

172
00:07:19,820 --> 00:07:21,858
-你当真 -是的 今晚可是平安夜
- Seriously? - Yeah. It's Christmas Eve.

173
00:07:21,858 --> 00:07:23,995
你总不能在你的车里过吧
Y-You can't spend it in your car.

174
00:07:24,060 --> 00:07:25,800
你们可真是好人
Wow, that's really nice of you guys.

175
00:07:26,100 --> 00:07:27,480
我要带些什么吗
Listen, can I bring anything?

176
00:07:27,900 --> 00:07:29,360
番茄酱 酱油 吸管
Ketchup, soy sauce, straws?

177
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:29,920
我们都有的
We're good.

178
00:07:31,140 --> 00:07:33,700
那 你可以跟在我们车后面去我们家
So, uh, why don't you follow us to our house?

179
00:07:33,700 --> 00:07:35,740
好的 开着你的"家"
Okay. In your house.

180
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:38,520
好的
All right!

181
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:40,040
-卡梅隆 -怎么了
- Cameron. - What?

182
00:07:43,032 --> 00:07:46,340
万事俱备 今晚9点整
Okay. Tonight, 9:00 sharp,

183
00:07:46,340 --> 00:07:48,120
我们各自打开一份礼物
we open one present each.

184
00:07:48,780 --> 00:07:50,220
睡衣 我们就穿着睡觉
Pajamas- which we sleep in.

185
00:07:50,470 --> 00:07:52,486
明天早上7点 曼尼
Tomorrow morning, 7:00 a.M., Manny,

186
00:07:52,540 --> 00:07:55,040
站在楼梯上拍圣诞照片
on the stairs for the Christmas picture.

187
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:57,720
然后我们打开礼物
Then we open presents.

188
00:07:57,860 --> 00:07:58,620
在哥伦比亚
In Colombia,

189
00:07:58,620 --> 00:08:01,080
人们午夜时打开礼物 然后一直守夜到早上
they open presents at midnight and stay up till morning.

190
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:02,200
我很确定他们确实是那样
I'm sure that they do,

191
00:08:02,260 --> 00:08:04,760
不过既然你没有在大街上看到山羊乱窜
but as you'll notice from the absence of goats in the street,

192
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:06,060
就说明我们并不在哥伦比亚
we are not in Colombia.

193
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:08,280
行了 我开玩笑的
Come on! I'm kidding.

194
00:08:09,100 --> 00:08:12,060
为什么不能融合点哥伦比亚传统习俗进去
Why can't we mix a couple of Colombian traditions in?

195
00:08:12,180 --> 00:08:13,880
-比如呢 -比如烟火
- Like what? - Like fireworks.

196
00:08:14,180 --> 00:08:15,900
得了吧 哥伦比亚才没有烟火呢
Come on. You don't have fireworks in Colombia.

197
00:08:15,992 --> 00:08:18,208
你们又想让我变成傻冒
You're trying to make me the inocente again.

198
00:08:18,300 --> 00:08:20,860
不 我们有的 晚上的天空很美
No, we do. At night the sky is beautiful-

199
00:08:20,860 --> 00:08:21,700
很有圣诞的气氛
very Christmassy.

200
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:22,980
那说不通啊
That doesn't make any sense.

201
00:08:23,140 --> 00:08:25,420
每个国家都有自己的传统
Look, every country has their own traditions.

202
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:27,200
比如 在我们的文化里
In our culture, for example,

203
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:29,660
送圣诞礼物的 是婴儿耶稣
the baby Jesus is the one... that brings the gifts,

204
00:08:29,660 --> 00:08:30,760
而不是圣诞老人
not the Santa Claus.

205
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:32,080
那根本就不合理
But that doesn't make sense.

206
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:35,380
一个新生儿怎么能拿得动所有的礼物
How could a newborn baby carry all those presents?

207
00:08:35,560 --> 00:08:37,120
他们连自己的手在哪都不知道
They don't even know where their hands are.

208
00:08:37,220 --> 00:08:38,920
至少婴儿能穿过烟囱啊
At least a baby can fit through a chimney.

209
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:41,820
那你怎么坐在婴儿耶稣的膝盖上
How would you sit on the baby Jesus' lap?

210
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:42,820
你会压扁他的
You'd squish it.

211
00:08:43,220 --> 00:08:44,940
曼尼 明年我们会谈谈
Manny, next year we'll talk about

212
00:08:44,940 --> 00:08:46,620
你们哥伦比亚的一些传统
some of your little Colombian traditions.

213
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,940
-好吗 或许 -"或许"就是不会的意思
- Okay? Maybe. - I know what "Maybe" Means.

214
00:08:49,300 --> 00:08:51,320
感觉你想要夺走我整个圣诞节
It's like you're trying to take away my whole Christmas.

215
00:08:53,280 --> 00:08:54,920
我不敢相信圣诞真没了
I can't believe it's all gone.

216
00:08:55,260 --> 00:08:56,700
老爸从不会坚持到底的
Dad never follows through.

217
00:08:57,040 --> 00:08:59,380
你确定不是你的某个朋友烧了沙发
Are you sure one of your friends didn't burn the couch?

218
00:08:59,380 --> 00:09:00,680
不要看我
Hey, don't look at me.

219
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:02,840
我们中只有一个人 曾经点火柴玩
Only one of us was ever caught playing with matches.

220
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:04,420
卢克
Luke?

221
00:09:04,420 --> 00:09:07,190
那是一年前的事了 承认是你干的吧
That was a year ago. Just admit you did it.

222
00:09:07,246 --> 00:09:08,784
-你承认吧 -不
- You admit you did it! - No!

223
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:11,060
好吧 我有个主意
Okay. Look, I have an idea.

224
00:09:12,020 --> 00:09:13,380
你们记得斯巴达克斯那部电影吗
Do you remember the movie Spartacus?

225
00:09:16,760 --> 00:09:17,840
我们这么做
Here's what we do:

226
00:09:17,860 --> 00:09:20,280
卢克 你去告诉爸妈是你做的
Luke, you tell Mom and Dad it's your fault.

227
00:09:20,420 --> 00:09:22,320
-可我没有 -那没关系
- I didn't do it. - It doesn't matter.

228
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:24,100
因为你招了后
Because after you confess,

229
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:27,320
我和海莉也会分别承认是我们做的
Haley and I will each confess to the same thing.

230
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:29,380
那有什么用
How does that do anything?

231
00:09:29,640 --> 00:09:31,980
他们会因为我们保护彼此而感动的
They'll be so touched that we're protecting each other...

232
00:09:31,980 --> 00:09:34,160
然后他们就会把圣诞节还给我们了
that they'll have to bring back Christmas.

233
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:35,360
太棒了
That's awesome.

234
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:38,560
为什么此计可行来着
How does it work again?

235
00:09:38,628 --> 00:09:40,500
我们会成为传奇的
We're gonna pass into legend.

236
00:09:40,500 --> 00:09:42,200
取消了圣诞节的父母亲
The parents who canceled Christmas.

237
00:09:42,380 --> 00:09:43,340
我还以为你会高兴
I thought you'd be happy.

238
00:09:43,411 --> 00:09:44,972
他们会把我们写进歌里
They'II write songs about us,

239
00:09:48,020 --> 00:09:49,420
你老是说我
You're the one who always says

240
00:09:49,420 --> 00:09:51,360
面对孩子时就狠不下心来
I shouldn't be such a pushover with the kids.

241
00:09:51,500 --> 00:09:53,338
所以你就这样表明自己的立场吗
So this is where you decide to make your stand?

242
00:09:53,338 --> 00:09:54,883
-菲尔 -好吧 好吧 听着
- Really, Phil? - Okay. Okay, look.

243
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:56,880
别担心 圣诞节会回来的
Don't worry. We're going to have Christmas.

244
00:09:56,957 --> 00:09:58,400
我们家孩子那么有责任有担当
We've raised our kids right.

245
00:09:58,400 --> 00:09:59,640
不管谁做的 都会主动站出来承认错误
Whoever did it will come forward.

246
00:09:59,715 --> 00:10:02,120
不然另外两个也会把他供出来的
Or the other two will rat 'em out.

247
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,560
爸 妈
Mom, Dad.

248
00:10:04,140 --> 00:10:08,080
卢克 有什么事吗
Hey, Luke. What, uh- What can we do for you?

249
00:10:11,700 --> 00:10:12,960
是我做的
I did it.

250
00:10:13,140 --> 00:10:15,780
我玩了火柴 对不起
I was playing with matches. I'm sorry.

251
00:10:15,835 --> 00:10:18,975
你 你 你做的对
You, uh- You did the right thing- Yeah.

252
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:22,180
承认错误是对的 不过
by confessing, but, um-

253
00:10:22,300 --> 00:10:24,180
你犯了错 小家伙
This is bad, buddy.

254
00:10:24,180 --> 00:10:25,640
性质非常恶劣 懂吗
I mean, really bad, okay?

255
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:27,220
克莱尔 你来处理一下吧
Claire, you want to handle this?

256
00:10:29,020 --> 00:10:31,500
卢克 你刚才为什么不说
Um, Luke, why didn't you say something?

257
00:10:31,577 --> 00:10:33,810
我也不知道
Mmm, I don't know.

258
00:10:34,540 --> 00:10:37,440
好吧 你爸爸和我对你失望至极
Okay, well, your father and I are extremely disappointed in you,

259
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:40,260
回你的房间去 去吧
so- go up to your room. Go on.

260
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:41,291
艾丽克斯
Alex!

261
00:10:41,291 --> 00:10:43,201
我们一会儿上去找你谈话 去吧
We'll be up to talk to you in a minute. Just go.

262
00:10:43,340 --> 00:10:44,080
-海莉 -怎么了
- Haley! - What?

263
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:46,120
-说话呀 -说什么
- Say something! - About what?

264
00:10:46,236 --> 00:10:48,195
-我收回刚才的招供 -怎么回事
- Uh, I take it back! - What is going on?

265
00:10:48,269 --> 00:10:50,080
她们俩原本也应该招工的
These guys were gonna say they did it too,

266
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,600
这样你们就会以我们仨为傲
and you were gonna be proud of all of us.

267
00:10:51,660 --> 00:10:52,580
我们为什么要那么做
Why would we do that?

268
00:10:52,660 --> 00:10:54,180
这孩子满嘴胡言完全不能信啊
I don't know what to believe with this kid.

269
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:55,900
骗子 不是我干的
Liars! I didn't do it!

270
00:10:56,020 --> 00:10:58,040
-也不是我干的 -别看我
- Well, it wasn't me. - Don't look at me.

271
00:10:58,192 --> 00:11:01,037
-搞什么啊 -等等
- Seriously? - Wait.

272
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:02,180
又没人承认了吗
Nobody did it again?

273
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:03,760
行 没关系
No, that's fine.

274
00:11:04,520 --> 00:11:07,160
猜猜会怎样 圣诞节依旧取消
Guess what? Christmas is still canceled.

275
00:11:07,900 --> 00:11:09,080
我是无所谓的
That's fine by me.

276
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:10,900
我们明年再过吧
Let's start working on next year.

277
00:11:10,980 --> 00:11:16,071
别忘了还有除夕 复活节 都不过了
Hey, and memo to New Year's Eve... and Easter-

278
00:11:16,140 --> 00:11:17,140
小心点
Watch your back!

279
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:22,260
我从海军退役后 算是开始环游世界了
So, after I left the marines, I just kinda traveled the world.

280
00:11:22,260 --> 00:11:24,920
现在我游走在各城之间 打些临时工
Now I go from town to town picking up odd jobs.

281
00:11:24,996 --> 00:11:26,695
有点像绿巨人
Oh. Kinda like the Hulk.

282
00:11:26,813 --> 00:11:30,502
真巧啊 那正是我在部队时的绰号
That's weird. That was my nickname in the corps-

283
00:11:30,578 --> 00:11:32,646
因为我的暴脾气
'cause of my bad temper.

284
00:11:34,800 --> 00:11:37,160
不管怎样 谢谢你们请我过来
Anyway, thanks for having me over,

285
00:11:37,224 --> 00:11:39,603
请我吃晚饭 帮我洗衣服
having me for dinner, letting me do my laundry.

286
00:11:39,720 --> 00:11:41,000
今天本来很不顺
It's not been a good day.

287
00:11:42,896 --> 00:11:47,794
斯科特 我有事要跟你坦白
Um, Scott, I-I have a confession to make.

288
00:11:47,859 --> 00:11:50,560
我没有
Um, I didn't, uh-

289
00:11:50,635 --> 00:11:52,308
我没有清洗洗衣槽
I didn't clean the lint tray,

290
00:11:52,371 --> 00:11:54,676
所以你的衣服可能会沾上些毛
so, um, your clothes might be a little pilly.

291
00:11:54,740 --> 00:11:56,220
没关系 我不在乎
Oh, no problem. That's the least of my worries.

292
00:11:56,580 --> 00:11:59,080
谢谢你们做的一切 我今天很开心
Thanks for everything. You guys made my day.

293
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:02,140
-至少可以以此补偿你 -什么意思
- It's the least we could do. - What do you mean?

294
00:12:03,020 --> 00:12:04,960
我不知道我在说什么
I don't know... what I was saying.

295
00:12:10,520 --> 00:12:12,680
-我们永远都别告诉他了 -完全正确
- I just say we never tell him. - Exactly.

296
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:15,810
我们给了他钱 热食 帮他洗衣服
We give him some money, a hot meal, laundry.

297
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,180
我想我们扯平了
I think we're square.

298
00:12:17,180 --> 00:12:19,520
同意 行了 这个东西怎么用
Agreed. Okay, how does this thing work?

299
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:23,000
我想应该是按中间的那个按钮 没错
I think you just press that button right there in the middle. Yeah.

300
00:12:23,057 --> 00:12:24,160
-我的天 -这有点...
- Oh, my - Okay. That...

301
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:25,820
摇得有点太高了 对吗
That seems a little high, doesn't it?

302
00:12:25,820 --> 00:12:27,320
没错 我才不要把莉莉放进去
Yes. I'm not putting Lily in that.

303
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:29,120
简直像是给宇航员训练用的
It's like something astronauts train in.

304
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:32,640
嚯嚯嚯 我来了 嚯嚯嚯 我来了
Ho, ho, ho! It's me! Ho, ho, ho! It's me!

305
00:12:32,700 --> 00:12:33,520
-你爸来了 -对
- It's your dad. - Yeah.

306
00:12:34,580 --> 00:12:35,400
嘿 老爸
Hey, Dad.

307
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:38,570
我给你们带了礼物
I brought your presents.

308
00:12:38,570 --> 00:12:40,080
我们不是明天要见你吗 杰
Aren't we seeing you tomorrow, Jay?

309
00:12:40,180 --> 00:12:41,524
这是给你们的平安夜礼物
These are your Christmas Eve gifts.

310
00:12:41,524 --> 00:12:42,266
-你知道规矩的 -是的
- You know the drill. - Oh, yeah.

311
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:44,640
你在睡觉前拆开 里面是睡衣
You open those up before bedtime. They're pajamas.

312
00:12:45,460 --> 00:12:46,960
还在保持这个传统啊
Still keeping traditions alive, huh?

313
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:47,820
总得有人传承优良传统啊
Well, someone has to.

314
00:12:47,940 --> 00:12:49,020
我家有两个哥伦比亚人
I got two Colombians at home

315
00:12:49,020 --> 00:12:50,860
想要把圣诞节变成五月节
trying to turn Christmas into Cinco de Mayo.

316
00:12:51,112 --> 00:12:53,541
你知道那是墨西哥的节日 对吧
You know that's Mexican, right?

317
00:12:53,541 --> 00:12:54,864
又有什么区别呢
Ah, burrito, "Bur-right-o."

318
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:56,560
圣诞节就是圣诞节
Christmas should be Christmas.

319
00:12:56,627 --> 00:13:00,053
站在楼梯上照相 热巧克力 拆礼物
Picture on the stairs, hot chocolate, opening the presents.

320
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:01,380
这才应该是
That was supposed to be

321
00:13:01,380 --> 00:13:03,140
家里又添了小孩的好处
the good thing about having a kid in the house again.

322
00:13:03,140 --> 00:13:05,060
我又能像我们以前那样过圣诞节了
I can have Christmas the way we used to.

323
00:13:05,160 --> 00:13:05,960
我懂你的意思了 杰
I hear you, Jay.

324
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:06,937
如果我现在在家里
If I was home right now,

325
00:13:06,937 --> 00:13:09,204
我肯定正在调一整浴缸的圣诞蛋酒
I'd be mixin' up a bathtub full of eggnog

326
00:13:09,280 --> 00:13:11,340
努力将一只油腻的乳猪 塞进圣诞老人的帽子里
and trying to squeeze a greased hog into a Santa hat.

327
00:13:11,397 --> 00:13:13,223
你以为我不怀念吗
You don't think I miss that?

328
00:13:13,280 --> 00:13:13,980
是吗
Do you?

329
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:20,380
重点是那些已经是永不褪色的回忆了
The point is that those are memories that I'll always have,

330
00:13:20,380 --> 00:13:22,380
但现在我有绝佳的机会
but now I have the perfect opportunity...

331
00:13:22,380 --> 00:13:24,120
来和我的新家人去创造我们新的回忆
to create new memories with my new family...

332
00:13:24,183 --> 00:13:26,107
终有一日这些回忆也会不同寻常
that are gonna be just as special someday.

333
00:13:26,170 --> 00:13:29,277
是的 小卡说得没错
Aw. No. Cam's right, you know.

334
00:13:29,340 --> 00:13:31,080
我们每年都会创造新的传统
We create new traditions every year.

335
00:13:31,140 --> 00:13:33,940
谁准备好去试试秋千了
So, who's ready to try the swing?

336
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:40,580
儿子 记得提醒我
Okay, now remind me.

337
00:13:40,580 --> 00:13:42,572
明天第一件事就是把这个放进烤炉
We put this in the oven first thing tomorrow

338
00:13:42,572 --> 00:13:45,396
因为杰想要三点的时候吃
'cause Jay wants to eat at 3:00.

339
00:13:45,480 --> 00:13:48,200
曼尼 是你把这个蜘蛛放在冰箱里的吗
Ay, Manny! Did you put this spider in the fridge?

340
00:13:48,264 --> 00:13:50,453
是啊 恶作剧嘛
Oh, yeah. Inocente.

341
00:13:50,527 --> 00:13:52,716
小家伙 怎么回事
Ay, papi, what's wrong?

342
00:13:52,780 --> 00:13:54,780
我想过个哥伦比亚式的圣诞节
I want to have Christmas like they do in Colombia.

343
00:13:55,260 --> 00:13:56,620
杰把事情都搞砸了
Jay is messing everything up.

344
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:58,480
曼尼 理解下他吧
Manny, try to understand.

345
00:13:58,900 --> 00:14:02,080
在杰的儿女尚小之时 他们有很美好的回忆
Jay has great memories with his kids when they were young.

346
00:14:02,080 --> 00:14:04,460
他只是想和你再现当年的美好回忆
And he just wants to recreate them with you.

347
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:08,060
那么我能给杰的最棒的圣诞节礼物
So, maybe the best gift I could give Jay would be...

348
00:14:08,060 --> 00:14:09,660
是陪他像以前那样过圣诞节吗
Christmas like he used to have it?

349
00:14:09,724 --> 00:14:12,465
你真是个乖孩子
Ay, you're such a beautiful boy!

350
00:14:12,529 --> 00:14:14,460
等你长大以后 我会很怀念
One day you're gonna grow up, and I'm gonna miss...

351
00:14:14,460 --> 00:14:16,940
你小时候所做得一切
all the things that you used to do as a little boy.

352
00:14:17,011 --> 00:14:20,229
好吧 但如果那个所谓的圣诞老人
Okay. But if this so-called Santa Claus...

353
00:14:20,300 --> 00:14:22,097
没送我一件酒红色的晚礼服
doesn't bring me a burgundy dinner jacket,

354
00:14:22,097 --> 00:14:24,296
我们会有大麻烦的
we're going to have a big problem.

355
00:14:26,460 --> 00:14:26,900
亲爱的
Honey?

356
00:14:29,520 --> 00:14:31,920
我们真的不该让步吗
Would it really be so bad to back down?

357
00:14:32,220 --> 00:14:34,640
那样孩子们再也不会把我们的威胁当回事了
And have the kids never take any of our threats seriously again?

358
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:35,400
是啊
Yeah.

359
00:14:40,500 --> 00:14:42,660
也许 孩子们会意识到
Or... the kids could realize...

360
00:14:42,660 --> 00:14:46,260
我们放弃了做父母的权威 做出巨大的牺牲
that we're making a supreme sacrifice by giving up our power

361
00:14:46,260 --> 00:14:47,500
来拯救他们的圣诞节
to save their Christmas.

362
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:49,620
从某种意义上来说
Which would, in a way, be

363
00:14:49,620 --> 00:14:51,840
会成为我们送给他们最棒的礼物
the greatest gift that we could ever give them.

364
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:54,600
那样反而会让他们更加尊重我们
And which would paradoxically make them respect us even more.

365
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:56,520
行了 算我痴心妄想 想想刚说的
Okay, forget that. Go back one.

366
00:14:56,620 --> 00:14:57,400
老爸老妈
Hey, guys.

367
00:14:59,849 --> 00:15:00,909
是我干的
It- it was me.

368
00:15:00,970 --> 00:15:02,632
-什么 -什么
- What? - What?

369
00:15:04,520 --> 00:15:06,480
我在学校发现了一根烟
I found a cigarette at school,

370
00:15:06,561 --> 00:15:11,791
家里没人的时候 我抽了一口
and when no one was home, I- I tried it.

371
00:15:11,860 --> 00:15:16,020
我想我可能拿得离沙发太近了
And I-I guess I held it too close to the couch.

372
00:15:16,900 --> 00:15:17,920
真的很抱歉
I'm so sorry.

373
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:20,020
你们可以不让我过圣诞节
You can take my Christmas away,

374
00:15:20,020 --> 00:15:22,100
但别让其他人也不能过
but don't take it from everyone else.

375
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:25,580
你能关心家人这点很不错
That is very noble of you to care about the family,

376
00:15:25,580 --> 00:15:27,520
但是你抽了烟 还撒了谎
but you still smoked and lied.

377
00:15:27,680 --> 00:15:28,740
你的行为需要严厉批评
That's really bad.

378
00:15:28,820 --> 00:15:31,540
-现在帮我去搬圣诞树吧 -菲尔
- Now help me grab the tree. - Phil.

379
00:15:31,920 --> 00:15:34,920
菲尔 艾丽克斯 回来
Phil, Alex, come on back.

380
00:15:38,540 --> 00:15:41,640
从12月26日开始 你被禁足一周
Starting December 26, you are grounded for a full week,

381
00:15:41,680 --> 00:15:43,280
包括除夕在内
and that includes New Year's Eve.

382
00:15:43,391 --> 00:15:45,304
-但是我... -没有商量的余地
- But, I was - Yeah, non-negotiable. So...

383
00:15:46,640 --> 00:15:46,960
好吧
Fine.

384
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:50,740
各位
Everybody!

385
00:15:50,740 --> 00:15:54,300
正式宣布 圣诞节回来啦
It's official! Christmas is back on!

386
00:15:54,360 --> 00:15:55,760
-是吗 -发生什么了
- It is? - What happened?

387
00:15:55,760 --> 00:15:56,440
无所谓啦
Doesn't matter.

388
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:58,560
长袜 彩灯 装饰物 花环
Stockings, lights, ornaments, wreath!

389
00:15:58,640 --> 00:16:00,120
-各就各位 开始行动 -好的
- Go, go, go! - Okay.

390
00:16:01,580 --> 00:16:04,340
我听着似乎是一件压力山大的工作啊
Well, that sounds like a stressful job to me.

391
00:16:05,380 --> 00:16:06,680
没你想得那么严重
Not as much as you'd think.

392
00:16:06,780 --> 00:16:08,240
他们总是确保有一人是空弹
They always made sure one of us had a blank,

393
00:16:08,380 --> 00:16:09,920
那样就没人知道谁是致命一击
so nobody knew who took the fatal shot.

394
00:16:10,840 --> 00:16:12,340
晚餐实在是太美味了
This was mighty tasty.

395
00:16:12,419 --> 00:16:14,800
我可不想呆得过久
Well, I don't want to overstay my welcome.

396
00:16:14,800 --> 00:16:15,480
我就先走一步了
You won't have me back.

397
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:18,400
你俩好好享受今晚余下的时光吧
You guys enjoy the rest of your night.

398
00:16:18,720 --> 00:16:19,460
你们都是好人
You're good people.

399
00:16:22,460 --> 00:16:24,420
斯科特 等等 等等
Scott. Wait, wait.

400
00:16:25,900 --> 00:16:26,960
别忘了你洗过的衣服
Don't forget your laundry.

401
00:16:27,055 --> 00:16:29,660
多谢 多谢 多谢
Oh! Thanks. Thanks, thanks, thanks, thanks.

402
00:16:29,660 --> 00:16:30,360
圣诞节快乐
Merry Christmas.

403
00:16:30,500 --> 00:16:32,180
斯科特 也祝你圣诞节快乐
Scott, merry Christmas to you, too.

404
00:16:32,180 --> 00:16:33,800
也祝你... 他妈的
And happy. Son of a bitch.

405
00:16:33,800 --> 00:16:36,420
-什么 -是新绿袖子唱诗班
- What? - Oh. It's the New Greensleevers.

406
00:16:36,620 --> 00:16:37,890
他们以前是卡梅隆的唱诗班成员
They're Cameron's old caroling group.

407
00:16:37,890 --> 00:16:38,982
今年他们把他开除了
They kicked him out this year.

408
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:41,940
把我从唱诗班开除就算了
I mean, it is one thing to kick me out of the group,

409
00:16:42,003 --> 00:16:43,784
竟然还来揭我伤疤
but to rub my nose in it!

410
00:16:43,900 --> 00:16:45,040
我要去把洒水器打开
I'm turning on the sprinklers.

411
00:16:45,160 --> 00:16:46,600
等一下 等一下
Wait. Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

412
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:48,880
我知道报仇的快感
I know it feels good to get even.

413
00:16:49,060 --> 00:16:50,280
相信我
Believe me.

414
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:53,820
看到别人眼中的恐惧很...
To see the fear in a man's eyes is-

415
00:16:53,820 --> 00:16:57,880
但有件事会让你更爽
but there's something that feels even better.

416
00:17:00,920 --> 00:17:01,440
那就是 宽恕
Forgiveness.

417
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:02,920
斯科特 你不明白
Scott, you don't understand.

418
00:17:02,920 --> 00:17:05,215
以前唱诗班就是我的追梦女孩
This- this group was my Dreamgirls.

419
00:17:05,580 --> 00:17:06,620
我就像是艾菲
I was Effie.

420
00:17:06,780 --> 00:17:09,540
你们知道我今天做的最棒的事是什么吗
You know what the best thing I did all day was?

421
00:17:10,980 --> 00:17:12,800
原谅你们害我被炒鱿鱼
Forgiving you for getting me fired.

422
00:17:28,380 --> 00:17:28,940
安德鲁
Andrew.

423
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:30,920
全体演出人员
Ensemble.

424
00:17:32,520 --> 00:17:36,920
我知道你们今晚在我家门口唱歌绝非巧合
Uh, I know it's no accident that you're here on my street tonight.

425
00:17:37,380 --> 00:17:43,360
而我 我只想对你们说 你们唱得很好
And I- I just wanted to say to you all that you sound great.

426
00:17:46,040 --> 00:17:47,340
还有 圣诞节快乐
And... merry Christmas.

427
00:17:49,117 --> 00:17:51,580
连你的道歉都走音了
Even your apology is off-key.

428
00:17:51,580 --> 00:17:52,500
老兄 没法忍了
Not cool, buddy.

429
00:17:54,460 --> 00:17:56,876
我还是快溜吧
Well, I should, uh, probably scoot.

430
00:17:58,111 --> 00:18:00,894
但是 但是 不是说要宽恕吗
But- but- but what about forgiveness?

431
00:18:01,100 --> 00:18:03,920
你人很好 而他是下三滥
You were nice. He was naughty.

432
00:18:09,244 --> 00:18:10,386
你去哪去了这么久
Where were you for so long?

433
00:18:10,386 --> 00:18:12,099
最后抢购了一下
Just a little last-minute shopping.

434
00:18:12,196 --> 00:18:14,074
-这是什么 -波瓦洛[甜甜圈]
- What's this? - Bunuelos.

435
00:18:14,180 --> 00:18:16,060
-是谁 什么 -芝士馅饼
- Who? What? - Cheese fritters.

436
00:18:16,220 --> 00:18:18,160
是哥伦比亚圣诞节的传统食物
It's a Colombian traditional Christmas food.

437
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:20,220
好的 新规定 从现在开始
Okay, new rule: From now on...

438
00:18:20,400 --> 00:18:22,860
与哥伦比亚有关的事 只许在哥伦比亚做
we do Colombian things when we're in Colombia.

439
00:18:23,040 --> 00:18:25,740
在美国 只许做与美国有关的事
We do American things when we're in America.

440
00:18:25,740 --> 00:18:27,060
也就是说 不许做你们的食物
That means no more of your food,

441
00:18:27,320 --> 00:18:28,340
不许放你们的音乐
no more of your music...

442
00:18:28,520 --> 00:18:30,860
尤其不许过你们疯狂的节日
and especially no more of your crazy holidays!

443
00:18:33,685 --> 00:18:36,274
-傻帽了吧 -杰
- Inocente! - Ay, Jay!

444
00:18:36,340 --> 00:18:37,673
什么 我说错了吗
What? Did I say it wrong?

445
00:18:37,673 --> 00:18:39,484
你们刚刚的样子就是很傻帽嘛
You two are total inocentes!

446
00:18:39,560 --> 00:18:41,180
你们应该看看自己脸上的表情
You should see the look on your faces.

447
00:18:41,960 --> 00:18:43,100
顺便说一句 你知道在平安夜
And by the way- You know how

448
00:18:43,100 --> 00:18:45,120
想买到烟火有多难吗
hard it is to get fireworks on Christmas Eve?

449
00:18:45,194 --> 00:18:47,688
快去 曼尼 谢谢
Go, Manny. Thank you.

450
00:18:52,888 --> 00:18:56,803
好的 又是一份给卢克的礼物
All righty. Here's another one for Luke.

451
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:59,200
-看起来像一本书 -我已经有一本书了
- Looks like a book. - I have a book already.

452
00:18:59,660 --> 00:19:02,920
那是怎么回事 我的老天 沙发在冒烟
What is that? Oh, my God. The couch is smoking.

453
00:19:08,040 --> 00:19:09,240
是阳光的原因
It's sunlight.

454
00:19:10,040 --> 00:19:11,220
是装饰物的原因
It's the ornament.

455
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:14,240
真酷 像放大镜聚焦一样
Cool. It's like a magnifying glass.

456
00:19:14,940 --> 00:19:17,280
真奇怪啊 沙发被烧出的洞
Hey, how weird is that? It's burning a hole...

457
00:19:17,280 --> 00:19:20,200
和艾丽克斯抽烟烧的洞刚好在同一个位置
in the exact same spot that Alex was smoking in.

458
00:19:20,800 --> 00:19:21,500
海莉[瞧你蠢的!]
Oh, Haley.

459
00:19:21,940 --> 00:19:23,800
艾丽克斯 你为什么要主动承担责任
Alex, why'd you take the blame?

460
00:19:24,380 --> 00:19:25,920
我不想错过圣诞节
I didn't want to lose Christmas.

461
00:19:27,220 --> 00:19:29,080
你真是太高尚了
That is so stinking beautiful.

462
00:19:30,760 --> 00:19:32,020
过来
Get in here.

463
00:19:32,480 --> 00:19:33,480
-不要 -来嘛
- No. - Yes.

464
00:19:33,480 --> 00:19:34,760
-不要 -来嘛
- Oh, no. - Yes.

465
00:19:34,871 --> 00:19:37,193
-太好了 -熊抱抱
- Oh, yes! - Bear hug!

466
00:19:39,301 --> 00:19:40,620
等等 你本打算因为一件我们都
Wait a- You were going to take

467
00:19:40,620 --> 00:19:42,700
没做过的事情 而不让我们过圣诞节吗
Christmas away for something that none of us did?

468
00:19:43,043 --> 00:19:46,580
圣诞节意味着放下过去朝前看
Well, um, Christmas is about moving forward.

469
00:19:46,580 --> 00:19:48,060
我可没听过那个说法
I've never heard that.

470
00:19:48,287 --> 00:19:50,140
确实 亲爱的 你似乎是信口开河的
Actually, honey, you did kinda shoot your mouth off.

471
00:19:50,140 --> 00:19:51,415
你还说我们是撒谎精
You called us all liars.

472
00:19:51,415 --> 00:19:55,353
没错 你就是那样说的
Yeah, you did, and then...

473
00:19:55,480 --> 00:19:58,420
我们别越说越起劲了 是我的错
Let's not all get worked up. I made a mistake!

474
00:19:59,140 --> 00:20:03,900
我犯错了 人难免会犯错的
I made a mistake. And people make mistakes.

475
00:20:04,040 --> 00:20:08,440
但人们会弥补犯下的错误
And they make up for those mistakes-

476
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:14,520
通过 带全家人去意大利来弥补
by... taking their family to Italy!

477
00:20:14,581 --> 00:20:15,966
我的天呐
Oh, my God! Yeah!

478
00:20:16,067 --> 00:20:20,544
-迪兰能一起去吗 -当然 当然
- Can Dylan come? - Yeah! Yeah!

479
00:20:22,773 --> 00:20:24,879
谁想来点鸡腿肉
Who wants some dark meat?

480
00:20:24,940 --> 00:20:27,800
每年的这个时候 我们就会经常谈论传统
We talk a lot about tradition this time of year.

481
00:20:29,460 --> 00:20:31,400
尽管我们深爱着自己的传统
But as much as we love our traditions,

482
00:20:32,220 --> 00:20:33,800
但有时候我们最美好的回忆
sometimes our best memories come

483
00:20:33,800 --> 00:20:36,580
却来自最颠覆传统的时刻
from the times that are the most untraditional.

484
00:20:36,651 --> 00:20:39,052
傻帽
Inocente!

485
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:43,520
我们记得爸妈发狂的那一年
We remember the year Mom and Dad went crazy.

486
00:20:43,587 --> 00:20:48,609
我们记得圣诞老人打了颂歌者的那一年
We remember the year Santa punched out the caroler.

487
00:20:50,820 --> 00:20:55,420
但对我来说 今年是让"传统"这个词
But for me, this was the year that the word "Tradition"...

488
00:20:55,420 --> 00:20:58,000
变得更有意义的一年
got a lot bigger.

489
00:21:09,743 --> 00:21:11,102
那是小卡
There's Cam.

490
00:21:27,312 --> 00:21:29,516
不是吧
Ah, you didn't.

491
00:21:30,140 --> 00:21:31,200
又被你整了
You got me again.
